Z||000004||Rick 88||10-31-2001||10:35 PM||||There is no listing for IAS shocks for an 88 Fiero. I am getting ready to install them on my 72 Trans Am. So far everyone that I have talked to likes the ride quality and handling.<P>Rick 88||||reg||1
Z||000005||Wannabe||11-01-2001||08:18 AM||||If it's an '88, shocks for a Buick GN might fit. The body is a bit larger than the shock body for the Fiero, so you need to do some very minor grinding to open up the hole on the lower control arm. I know that Bilstein offers a shock for the GN, which may be another good alternative. ||||reg||1
